              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "தரகர் — tarakar — \"a broker\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "வீடு வாங்க ஒரு தரகரின் உதவியை நாடினோம். vīṭu vāṅka oru tarakariṉ utaviyai nāṭiṉōm. To buy a house we sought the help of a broker."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The fee a broker takes is தரகு."
            }
          ]
        },
