              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "தரகர் (tarakar) is native Dravidian: DEDR 3090 gives தரகு (taraku), \"brokerage, a middleman's fee\", and தரகன் (tarakaṉ), \"a broker\"; தரகர் is the form with the respectful -அர்."
            }
          ]
        },
