              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "கணிசமாக — kaṇicamāka — \"considerably\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "இந்த ஆண்டு விற்பனை கணிசமாக அதிகரித்தது. inta āṇṭu viṟpaṉai kaṇicamāka atikarittatu. This year sales went up considerably."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "An adverb in -ஆக; before a noun it is கணிசமான: கணிசமான தொகை, a sizeable sum."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The origin of கணிசமாக (kaṇicamāka) is not settled: it is the -ஆக adverb of கணிசம் (kaṇicam), \"a considerable amount\", whose source is unclear."
            }
          ]
        },
